  "body": "I *think* [Using a reverse proxy with Synapse](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/docs/reverse_proxy.md) uses the deprecated Admin API endpoint, for example for nginx:\r\n\r\n`location ~* ^(\\/_matrix|\\/_synapse\\/client) {`\r\n\r\ninstead of\r\n\r\n`location ~* ^(\\/_matrix|\\/_synapse\\/admin) {`\r\n\r\nsee: https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/develop/UPGRADE.rst#removal-historical-synapse-admin-api",
